<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Kellie's Green Farms Dashboard</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#03170f;color:white}
header{padding:18px 5%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#08271a;border-bottom:1px solid #24f58a55}
.logo{color:#24f58a;font-weight:bold}
a{color:#24f58a;text-decoration:none}
main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:30px 5%}
.welcome{color:#24f58a;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px}
h1{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:10px}
.subtitle{color:#abc5b5;margin-bottom:25px}
.balance{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0b4027,#092719);padding:25px;border-radius:17px;border:1px solid #24f58a66;margin-bottom:22px}
.balance p{color:#b6d5c2;font-size:13px}
.balance h2{font-size:34px;color:#24f58a;margin-top:12px}
.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:35px}
.action{background:#0b3020;border:1px solid #24f58a66;padding:17px 8px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold}
.action:hover,.activate:hover{background:#12633b}form .activate{width:100%;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px}
h2.section{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:18px}
.packages{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}
.package{background:#092719;border:1px solid #24f58a44;border-radius:15px;overflow:hidden}
.package img{width:100%;height:170px;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.package-content{padding:20px}
.package h3{color:#24f58a;margin-bottom:10px}
.package p{color:#c1d8ca;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9}
.activate{display:block;text-align:center;background:#087a42;color:white;padding:13px;border-radius:9px;margin-top:15px;font-weight:bold}
.notice{color:#91ac9b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:25px}
@media(max-width:650px){.packages{grid-template-columns:1fr}.actions{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}h1{font-size:23px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">🌱 KELLIE'S GREEN FARMS</div>
<a href="/logout">Logout ↗</a>
</header>
<main>
<div class="welcome">YOUR FARM ACCOUNT</div>
<h1>Welcome, {{ fullname }}!</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Manage your farm account and activities.</p>

<div class="balance">
<p>AVAILABLE ACCOUNT BALANCE</p>
<h2>₦{{ "{:,.2f}".format(balance|float) }}</h2>
</div>

<div class="actions">
<a class="action" href="/deposit">💳<br><br>Deposit</a>
<a class="action" href="/withdraw">💸<br><br>Withdrawal</a>
<a class="action" href="/referrals">👥<br><br>Referrals</a>
<a class="action" href="/history">📋<br><br>History</a>
</div>

<h2 class="section">Agricultural Packages</h2>
<div class="packages">

<div class="package">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500382017468-9049fed747ef?w=900" alt="Green crop farm">
<div class="package-content">
<h3>BIG SEED</h3>
<p>Capital: ₦10,000</p>
<p>Daily reward: ₦700</p><p>Total reward after 30 days: ₦21,000</p>
<p>Duration: 30 days</p>
<form method="POST" action="/activate/big"><button class="activate" type="submit">Activate Plan</button></form>
</div></div>

<div class="package">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500937386664-56d1dfef3854?w=900" alt="Agricultural field">
<div class="package-content">
<h3>MEDIUM</h3>
<p>Capital: ₦5,000</p>
<p>Daily reward: ₦400</p><p>Total reward after 30 days: ₦12,000</p>
<p>Duration: 30 days</p>
<form method="POST" action="/activate/medium"><button class="activate" type="submit">Activate Plan</button></form>
</div></div>

<div class="package">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499529112087-3cb3b73cec95?w=900" alt="Farm crops">
<div class="package-content">
<h3>SMALL</h3>
<p>Capital: ₦2,000</p>
<p>Daily reward: ₦300</p><p>Total reward after 30 days: ₦9,000</p>
<p>Duration: 30 days</p>
<form method="POST" action="/activate/small"><button class="activate" type="submit">Activate Plan</button></form>
</div></div>

<div class="package">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523348837708-15d4a09cfac2?w=900" alt="Crop cultivation">
<div class="package-content">
<h3>STARTER</h3>
<p>Capital: ₦1,000</p>
<p>Daily reward: ₦200</p><p>Total reward after 30 days: ₦6,000</p>
<p>Duration: 30 days</p>
<form method="POST" action="/activate/starter"><button class="activate" type="submit">Activate Plan</button></form>
</div></div>

</div>

<p class="notice">
Daily rewards are credited when they become due and the account is next processed.
All reward figures are illustrative, not guaranteed. Agricultural activities
involve risk, including possible loss of capital. Review the business terms
before making a financial commitment.
</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
